<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 4.0 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!-- ScoreStudio sample: two voices on one staff, the cases that collided in a real Finale score. Measure 1: a rest of the
     lower voice under a chord of the upper voice. Measure 2: the voices a second apart. Measure 3: both voices on the
     same pitch with the same values (they share their noteheads). Measure 4: the same pitch as a whole note and a dotted
     half (different noteheads). Measure 5: a whole-measure rest of the lower voice under the upper voice. Measure 6: a
     whole-measure rest of the upper voice over the lower voice. Written for this test. -->
